{"id":"83fa8e237c5c3ddb","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-ef-linear-orders.md","title":"EF Game on Linear Orders","display":"thm-ef-linear-orders — EF Game on Linear Orders","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-ef-linear-orders","aliases":["57-thm-ef-linear-orders"],"display":"thm-ef-linear-orders — EF Game on Linear Orders","depends_on":["[[57-df-ef-game]]","[[57-df-n-equivalence]]","[[57-df-quantifier-rank]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-total-order]]","[[57-df-dlo]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-ef-linear-orders"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-ef-linear-orders</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ef-linear-orders — EF Game on Linear Orders"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40a9587a80026ff4\" href=\"?note=40a9587a80026ff4\" title=\"57-df-ef-game\">57-df-ef-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f60efdcc5c3b9010\" href=\"?note=f60efdcc5c3b9010\" title=\"57-df-n-equivalence\">57-df-n-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c712d26a957f90f\" href=\"?note=6c712d26a957f90f\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-rank\">57-df-quantifier-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59981a2d27254902\" href=\"?note=59981a2d27254902\" title=\"57-df-dlo\">57-df-dlo</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_&lt;\">\\(S_&lt;\\)</span> 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，没有常量及函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_&lt;}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>；两结构的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 解释均满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1e5d7c3f7413640b\" href=\"?note=1e5d7c3f7413640b\" title=\"57-df-total-order\">57-df-total-order</a> 的严格全序条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLO}\">\\(\\mathrm{DLO}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NoEnd}\">\\(\\mathrm{NoEnd}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"59981a2d27254902\" href=\"?note=59981a2d27254902\" title=\"57-df-dlo\">57-df-dlo</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为非空有限集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span> 保持 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f60efdcc5c3b9010\" href=\"?note=f60efdcc5c3b9010\" title=\"57-df-n-equivalence\">57-df-n-equivalence</a> 对所有开公式的全称赋值版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n\">\\(W_n\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"40a9587a80026ff4\" href=\"?note=40a9587a80026ff4\" title=\"57-df-ef-game\">57-df-ef-game</a> 的递归获胜位置集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空元组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|A|\\ge2^n\\land|B|\\ge2^n\\to\\langle n,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon\\rangle\\in W_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|A|\\ge2^n\\land|B|\\ge2^n\\to\\langle n,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon\\rangle\\in W_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|A|\\ge2^n\\land|B|\\ge2^n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_&lt;}\\;\n(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\le n\\to(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|A|\\ge2^n\\land|B|\\ge2^n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_&lt;}\\;\n(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\le n\\to(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\equiv_n\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow |A|=|B|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\equiv_n\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow |A|=|B|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原大小下界只保证空位置游戏及有限秩句子等价，不保证本册更强的开公式版本。若 |A|=m&lt;|B|，无量词公式 ∨_{i&lt;j≤m+1}(x_i=x_j) 在 A 对所有赋值真、在 B 并非如此，已经区分 ≡_0。原 ≡_n 定义不改。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ef-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f60efdcc5c3b9010","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea